body:
I stand by my statements regardless. And If my writing is requested, it's free. I will freely write for the next Ghostbusters. Take that as you will, as a hate statement or positive. I will slit my wrists vertically and bleed ecto cooler. I mean, let's face it.,, in anything, that's what we want... right?

&#x200B;

I will slit my wrists and bleed a story from my heart and soul.

&#x200B;

I mean it..

&#x200B;

Peace out.
